  "body": "Looking for your first home, your next project or simply a chance to get your foot on the property ladder in a fantastic location? Welcome to 1 Albatross Road, Red Beach, where opportunity meets potential! Comfortable and perfectly liveable as it is, this three-bedroom home offers an exciting chance to bring your ideas to life, add your own personal touch and create something really special. With our investor owner ready to cash out, this is your chance to get the perfect starter home in an incredible location. \r\n\r\nOccupying a corner position, this two level home offers a surprisingly generous amount of space both inside and out. There's plenty to love here already, and with a little imagination and some thoughtful updates, you could transform this well-loved home into something incredible. We're so excited at the possibilities we've even included a few concept images to help spark your imagination.\r\n\r\nHere are some of the features we think you'll love:\r\n\r\n- Three good-sized bedrooms spread across two levels, with two on the upper level, including the master bedroom with its own balcony, and a third downstairs offering flexibility for family, guests or working from home.\r\n- Light-filled living and dining spaces create a welcoming heart of the home, complete with a cosy wood burner and sliding doors opening out to a sunny courtyard, perfect for morning coffees, relaxed afternoons or entertaining friends.\r\n- A practical kitchen connects easily with the living spaces, offering plenty of scope to modernise, refresh and make it your own, with the existing layout providing a great starting point.\r\n- Bathroom facilities on both levels add everyday convenience, with plenty of opportunity to update and add your own style over time.\r\n- The corner position provides welcome outdoor space, with established greenery, lawn areas, a paved courtyard and room to create a lovely garden retreat.\r\n- A generous garage, separate laundry and additional storage add everyday practicality, while the home's original features offer a fantastic blank canvas for anyone keen to add value and reap the rewards.\r\n\r\nNow let's talk about the location! Red Beach is one of those places people love to call home, with its relaxed coastal atmosphere and wonderful sense of community. From here, you can walk to the local shops, beautiful Red Beach and nearby reserves, while Orewa's cafes, restaurants, shopping and stunning beachfront are just a short drive away. In the zone for Red Beach School and also an easy distance to Kingsway Schools and Stella Maris.\r\n\r\nWhether you're taking that exciting first step into home ownership, looking for a project with potential or simply wanting to secure your place in a sought-after coastal neighbourhood, this little gem is packed with possibilities.\r\nBring your imagination, see the potential and make it your own! Call Tyler Broughton or Emmy Jansen for more information or come along to one of our open homes. Your next chapter could start right here!\r\n\r\n*There is a building report available to all buyers upon request\r\n\r\nOrewa: Auction: 4:00pm, Thursday 26th November 2026 In Rooms, Ray White Orewa, (unless sold prior). You can watch the auction live here https://rwcarpenterrealty.co.nz/watch-our-auctions-live",
